<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\ホラーサウンド.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "$000080" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>At that moment, a question surfaced.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I already know that getting doused in the first generation's blood makes you the second generation.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So then... 
{PAUSE ""}
what if... just hypothetically?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What happens if you get doused in the second generation's blood?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Like me.<PG>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "30" "30" "0" "30"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\心臓の鼓動.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>Ugah...!</STYLE>
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>Suddenly an indescribable sensation raced through me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In time with the pulsing of my heart, the sensation raced through me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And as if every cell in my body craved that sensation, my heartbeat grew faster and faster.<PG>
This is...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
{PLAYSND "環境音\心臓の鼓動.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "30" "30" "0" "30"}
I want to kill―
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{QUAKESTOP "100"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
{PLAYSND "環境音\心臓の鼓動.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "30" "30" "0" "30"}
I want to kill―
{WAITPLAY "VOICE2" "CLICK"}
{QUAKESTOP "100"}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mama</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Shaking <STYLE ID="3">Sakura-san's</STYLE> body, <STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Haruka-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Clinging to <STYLE ID="3">Sakura-san's</STYLE> back, <STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Rubbing her face with a bloody hand, <STYLE ID="2">Haruka-san</STYLE>.<BR>
The second generation's blood got on their bodies too.<PG>
Was it because I touched the blood first?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Haruka-san</STYLE> didn't seem to feel that sensation yet.<PG>
But I know.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In a few more seconds, they too will be ruled by this sensation, the same as me―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This sensation―
{PAUSE ""}
what this sensation truly is―<PG>
{PLAYSND "環境音\心臓の鼓動.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "30" "30" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="5">I want to kill―</STYLE>
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{QUAKESTOP "100"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
{PLAYSND "環境音\心臓の鼓動.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "30" "30" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="5">I want to kill―</STYLE>
{WAITPLAY "VOICE2" "CLICK"}
{QUAKESTOP "100"}
<PG>
Ah, now I understand.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This sensation―
{PAUSE ""}
it's murderous intent.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In that instant, I was disgusted by my own lack of thoroughness.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why hadn't I tried to find out what happens if you touch the second generation's blood?<PG>
But even that regret was soon written over by a different sensation.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
By the sensation called murderous intent.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What I want to do now is―<PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
